{"id":"d2d050e5f4c4634e","group":"FormalSystem","path":"FormalSystem/733_EL.md","title":"733 EL","display":"733_EL","type":"system","metadata":{},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[],"html":"<p><span class=\"inline-tag\">#FormalSystem</span></p>\n<h1 id=\"733-EL\">733 EL</h1>\n<h1 id=\"1.-原始符号\">1. 原始符号</h1>\n<p>令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma=(N_C,N_R)\">\\(\\Sigma=(N_C,N_R)\\)</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"N_C\">\\(N_C\\)</span> 为概念名集合，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"N_R\">\\(N_R\\)</span> 为角色名集合，且二者不交。EL 的原始构造子为：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{name},\\quad\\operatorname{top},\\quad\\operatorname{conj},\\quad\\operatorname{exists}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{name},\\quad\\operatorname{top},\\quad\\operatorname{conj},\\quad\\operatorname{exists}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>其型别为：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{name}:N_C\\to\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{EL}},\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{top}\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{EL}},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{name}:N_C\\to\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{EL}},\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{top}\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{EL}},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{conj}:\n\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{EL}}\\times\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{EL}}\n\\to\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{EL}},\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{exists}:N_R\\times\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{EL}}\\to\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{EL}}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{conj}:\n\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{EL}}\\times\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{EL}}\n\\to\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{EL}},\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{exists}:N_R\\times\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{EL}}\\to\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{EL}}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"2.-概念表达式\">2. 概念表达式</h1>\n<p>定义 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{EL}}\">\\(\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{EL}}\\)</span> 为满足下列条款的最小集合：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\top=\\operatorname{top}\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{EL}}\">\\(\\top=\\operatorname{top}\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{EL}}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in N_C\">\\(A\\in N_C\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{name}(A)\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{EL}}\">\\(\\operatorname{name}(A)\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{EL}}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C,D\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{EL}}\">\\(C,D\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{EL}}\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{conj}(C,D)\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{EL}}\">\\(\\operatorname{conj}(C,D)\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{EL}}\\)</span>，显示为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C\\sqcap D\">\\(C\\sqcap D\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\\in N_R\">\\(R\\in N_R\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{EL}}\">\\(C\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{EL}}\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{exists}(R,C)\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{EL}}\">\\(\\operatorname{exists}(R,C)\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{EL}}\\)</span>，显示为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\exists R.C\">\\(\\exists R.C\\)</span>。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>EL 不含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bot,\\neg,\\sqcup,\\forall R.C\">\\(\\bot,\\neg,\\sqcup,\\forall R.C\\)</span> 或数目限制。</p>\n<h1 id=\"3.-包含式与-TBox\">3. 包含式与 TBox</h1>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Inc}_{\\mathsf{EL}}=\\{(C,D):C,D\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{EL}}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Inc}_{\\mathsf{EL}}=\\{(C,D):C,D\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{EL}}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>包含式 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(C,D)\">\\((C,D)\\)</span> 显示为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C\\sqsubseteq D\">\\(C\\sqsubseteq D\\)</span>，并定义证明判断载体</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Jdg}_{\\mathsf{EL}}=\\mathsf{Inc}_{\\mathsf{EL}}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Jdg}_{\\mathsf{EL}}=\\mathsf{Inc}_{\\mathsf{EL}}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>TBox 载体为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{TBox}_{\\mathsf{EL}}\n=\\{\\mathcal T\\subseteq\\mathsf{Inc}_{\\mathsf{EL}}:\\mathcal T\\text{ 有限}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{TBox}_{\\mathsf{EL}}\n=\\{\\mathcal T\\subseteq\\mathsf{Inc}_{\\mathsf{EL}}:\\mathcal T\\text{ 有限}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"4.-自由名字、替换与等价\">4. 自由名字、替换与等价</h1>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FN}:\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{EL}}\\to\\mathcal P(N_C\\cup N_R)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FN}:\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{EL}}\\to\\mathcal P(N_C\\cup N_R)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义为：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FN}(\\top)=\\varnothing,\\quad\n\\operatorname{FN}(A)=\\{A\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FN}(\\top)=\\varnothing,\\quad\n\\operatorname{FN}(A)=\\{A\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FN}(C\\sqcap D)=\\operatorname{FN}(C)\\cup\\operatorname{FN}(D),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FN}(C\\sqcap D)=\\operatorname{FN}(C)\\cup\\operatorname{FN}(D),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FN}(\\exists R.C)=\\{R\\}\\cup\\operatorname{FN}(C).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FN}(\\exists R.C)=\\{R\\}\\cup\\operatorname{FN}(C).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义无绑定名字函数：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{BN}(C)=\\varnothing\n\\quad(C\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{EL}}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{BN}(C)=\\varnothing\n\\quad(C\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{EL}}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>对每个名字排序 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\\in\\{N_C,N_R\\}\">\\(S\\in\\{N_C,N_R\\}\\)</span> 固定无重复枚举 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"e^S_0,e^S_1,\\ldots\">\\(e^S_0,e^S_1,\\ldots\\)</span>。若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\\subseteq S\">\\(X\\subseteq S\\)</span> 有限，则</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{fresh}_{\\mathsf{EL}}(S,X)=e^S_m,\n\\quad\nm=\\min\\{k:e^S_k\\notin X\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{fresh}_{\\mathsf{EL}}(S,X)=e^S_m,\n\\quad\nm=\\min\\{k:e^S_k\\notin X\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>给定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\theta_C:N_C\\to\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{EL}}\">\\(\\theta_C:N_C\\to\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{EL}}\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\theta_R:N_R\\to N_R\">\\(\\theta_R:N_R\\to N_R\\)</span>，替换 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sub}_{\\theta_C,\\theta_R}\">\\(\\operatorname{Sub}_{\\theta_C,\\theta_R}\\)</span> 为：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sub}(\\top)=\\top,\\quad\n\\operatorname{Sub}(A)=\\theta_C(A),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Sub}(\\top)=\\top,\\quad\n\\operatorname{Sub}(A)=\\theta_C(A),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sub}(C\\sqcap D)=\\operatorname{Sub}(C)\\sqcap\\operatorname{Sub}(D),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Sub}(C\\sqcap D)=\\operatorname{Sub}(C)\\sqcap\\operatorname{Sub}(D),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sub}(\\exists R.C)=\\exists\\theta_R(R).\\operatorname{Sub}(C).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Sub}(\\exists R.C)=\\exists\\theta_R(R).\\operatorname{Sub}(C).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C\\equiv_\\alpha^{\\mathsf{EL}}D\">\\(C\\equiv_\\alpha^{\\mathsf{EL}}D\\)</span> 当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C=D\">\\(C=D\\)</span>。形式化地，</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\equiv_\\alpha^{\\mathsf{EL}}\n=\n\\{(C,C):C\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{EL}}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\equiv_\\alpha^{\\mathsf{EL}}\n=\n\\{(C,C):C\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{EL}}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\exists R.C\">\\(\\exists R.C\\)</span> 是角色限制构造子，不绑定概念名或角色名；捕获避免重命名就是保持排序的有限支撑替换，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{fresh}_{\\mathsf{EL}}\">\\(\\operatorname{fresh}_{\\mathsf{EL}}\\)</span> 只用于选择未出现在有限名字集中的新名字。</p>\n<h1 id=\"5.-公理集合\">5. 公理集合</h1>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{EL}}(\\mathcal T)\n=\\mathcal T\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{refl}}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\top}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\sqcap E1}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\sqcap E2}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{EL}}(\\mathcal T)\n=\\mathcal T\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{refl}}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\top}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\sqcap E1}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\sqcap E2}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{refl}}=\\{C\\sqsubseteq C:C\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{EL}}\\},\n\\quad\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\top}=\\{C\\sqsubseteq\\top:C\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{EL}}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{refl}}=\\{C\\sqsubseteq C:C\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{EL}}\\},\n\\quad\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\top}=\\{C\\sqsubseteq\\top:C\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{EL}}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\sqcap E1}=\\{C\\sqcap D\\sqsubseteq C:C,D\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{EL}}\\},\n\\quad\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\sqcap E2}=\\{C\\sqcap D\\sqsubseteq D:C,D\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{EL}}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\sqcap E1}=\\{C\\sqcap D\\sqsubseteq C:C,D\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{EL}}\\},\n\\quad\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\sqcap E2}=\\{C\\sqcap D\\sqsubseteq D:C,D\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{EL}}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"6.-推理规则\">6. 推理规则</h1>\n<p>传递、合取引入和存在限制单调规则分别显示为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\frac{C\\sqsubseteq D\\qquad D\\sqsubseteq E}{C\\sqsubseteq E},\n\\qquad\n\\frac{C\\sqsubseteq D\\qquad C\\sqsubseteq E}{C\\sqsubseteq D\\sqcap E},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\frac{C\\sqsubseteq D\\qquad D\\sqsubseteq E}{C\\sqsubseteq E},\n\\qquad\n\\frac{C\\sqsubseteq D\\qquad C\\sqsubseteq E}{C\\sqsubseteq D\\sqcap E},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\frac{C\\sqsubseteq D}{\\exists R.C\\sqsubseteq\\exists R.D}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\frac{C\\sqsubseteq D}{\\exists R.C\\sqsubseteq\\exists R.D}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>它们形式化为下列三个有类型关系：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{tr}}\n\\subseteq\n(\\mathsf{Jdg}_{\\mathsf{EL}})^2\\times\\mathsf{Jdg}_{\\mathsf{EL}},\n\\qquad\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{tr}}=\\{(((C,D),(D,E)),(C,E)):C,D,E\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{EL}}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{tr}}\n\\subseteq\n(\\mathsf{Jdg}_{\\mathsf{EL}})^2\\times\\mathsf{Jdg}_{\\mathsf{EL}},\n\\qquad\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{tr}}=\\{(((C,D),(D,E)),(C,E)):C,D,E\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{EL}}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\sqcap I}\n\\subseteq\n(\\mathsf{Jdg}_{\\mathsf{EL}})^2\\times\\mathsf{Jdg}_{\\mathsf{EL}},\n\\qquad\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\sqcap I}=\\{(((C,D),(C,E)),(C,D\\sqcap E)):C,D,E\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{EL}}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\sqcap I}\n\\subseteq\n(\\mathsf{Jdg}_{\\mathsf{EL}})^2\\times\\mathsf{Jdg}_{\\mathsf{EL}},\n\\qquad\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\sqcap I}=\\{(((C,D),(C,E)),(C,D\\sqcap E)):C,D,E\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{EL}}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\exists}\n\\subseteq\n\\mathsf{Jdg}_{\\mathsf{EL}}\\times\\mathsf{Jdg}_{\\mathsf{EL}},\n\\qquad\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\exists}=\\{(((C,D)),(\\exists R.C,\\exists R.D)):R\\in N_R,\\ C,D\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{EL}}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\exists}\n\\subseteq\n\\mathsf{Jdg}_{\\mathsf{EL}}\\times\\mathsf{Jdg}_{\\mathsf{EL}},\n\\qquad\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\exists}=\\{(((C,D)),(\\exists R.C,\\exists R.D)):R\\in N_R,\\ C,D\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{EL}}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{EL}}=\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{tr}}\\cup\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\sqcap I}\\cup\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\exists}\">\\(\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{EL}}=\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{tr}}\\cup\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\sqcap I}\\cup\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\exists}\\)</span>。</p>\n<h1 id=\"7.-证明对象\">7. 证明对象</h1>\n<p>从 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal T\">\\(\\mathcal T\\)</span> 出发的 EL 证明是非空有限序列 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi=(I_0,\\ldots,I_{m-1})\">\\(\\pi=(I_0,\\ldots,I_{m-1})\\)</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(m\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m&gt;0\">\\(m&gt;0\\)</span>、每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I_i\\in\\mathsf{Jdg}_{\\mathsf{EL}}\">\\(I_i\\in\\mathsf{Jdg}_{\\mathsf{EL}}\\)</span>，且每行满足：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I_i\\in\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{EL}}(\\mathcal T)\">\\(I_i\\in\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{EL}}(\\mathcal T)\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j,k&lt;i\">\\(j,k&lt;i\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"((I_j,I_k),I_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{tr}}\">\\(((I_j,I_k),I_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{tr}}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j,k&lt;i\">\\(j,k&lt;i\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"((I_j,I_k),I_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\sqcap I}\">\\(((I_j,I_k),I_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\sqcap I}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j&lt;i\">\\(j&lt;i\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"((I_j),I_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\exists}\">\\(((I_j),I_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\exists}\\)</span>。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>定义证明谓词：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Proof}_{\\mathsf{EL}}(\\mathcal T,\\pi,C\\sqsubseteq D)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Proof}_{\\mathsf{EL}}(\\mathcal T,\\pi,C\\sqsubseteq D)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi\">\\(\\pi\\)</span> 是满足上述四类行条件且末项为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(C,D)\">\\((C,D)\\)</span> 的非空有限序列。</p>\n<h1 id=\"8.-可导出关系\">8. 可导出关系</h1>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal T\\vdash_{\\mathsf{EL}}C\\sqsubseteq D\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal T\\vdash_{\\mathsf{EL}}C\\sqsubseteq D\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>当且仅当存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi\">\\(\\pi\\)</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Proof}_{\\mathsf{EL}}(\\mathcal T,\\pi,C\\sqsubseteq D)\">\\(\\operatorname{Proof}_{\\mathsf{EL}}(\\mathcal T,\\pi,C\\sqsubseteq D)\\)</span>。</p>\n<h1 id=\"9.-语义结构与解释\">9. 语义结构与解释</h1>\n<p>令</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{KB}_{\\mathsf{EL}}=\n\\{\\mathcal T\\subseteq\\mathsf{Inc}_{\\mathsf{EL}}:\\mathcal T\\text{ 有限}\\}\\times\\{\\varnothing\\}\\times\\{\\varnothing\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{KB}_{\\mathsf{EL}}=\n\\{\\mathcal T\\subseteq\\mathsf{Inc}_{\\mathsf{EL}}:\\mathcal T\\text{ 有限}\\}\\times\\{\\varnothing\\}\\times\\{\\varnothing\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Str}_{\\mathsf{EL}}\">\\(\\mathsf{Str}_{\\mathsf{EL}}\\)</span> 是所有 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal I=(\\Delta,\\iota_C,\\iota_R)\">\\(\\mathcal I=(\\Delta,\\iota_C,\\iota_R)\\)</span> 的集合，满足</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Delta\\ne\\varnothing,\\quad\n\\iota_C:N_C\\to\\mathcal P(\\Delta),\\quad\n\\iota_R:N_R\\to\\mathcal P(\\Delta\\times\\Delta).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Delta\\ne\\varnothing,\\quad\n\\iota_C:N_C\\to\\mathcal P(\\Delta),\\quad\n\\iota_R:N_R\\to\\mathcal P(\\Delta\\times\\Delta).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\llbracket-\\rrbracket_{\\mathcal I}^{\\mathsf{EL}}:\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{EL}}\\to\\mathcal P(\\Delta)\">\\(\\llbracket-\\rrbracket_{\\mathcal I}^{\\mathsf{EL}}:\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{EL}}\\to\\mathcal P(\\Delta)\\)</span>：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\llbracket\\top\\rrbracket=\\Delta,\\quad\n\\llbracket A\\rrbracket=\\iota_C(A),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\llbracket\\top\\rrbracket=\\Delta,\\quad\n\\llbracket A\\rrbracket=\\iota_C(A),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\llbracket C\\sqcap D\\rrbracket=\\llbracket C\\rrbracket\\cap\\llbracket D\\rrbracket,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\llbracket C\\sqcap D\\rrbracket=\\llbracket C\\rrbracket\\cap\\llbracket D\\rrbracket,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\llbracket\\exists R.C\\rrbracket=\n\\{x\\in\\Delta:\\exists y\\in\\Delta((x,y)\\in\\iota_R(R)\\land y\\in\\llbracket C\\rrbracket)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\llbracket\\exists R.C\\rrbracket=\n\\{x\\in\\Delta:\\exists y\\in\\Delta((x,y)\\in\\iota_R(R)\\land y\\in\\llbracket C\\rrbracket)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"10.-满足关系与语义后承\">10. 满足关系与语义后承</h1>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal I\\models_{\\mathsf{EL}}C\\sqsubseteq D\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\llbracket C\\rrbracket_{\\mathcal I}^{\\mathsf{EL}}\\subseteq\n\\llbracket D\\rrbracket_{\\mathcal I}^{\\mathsf{EL}}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal I\\models_{\\mathsf{EL}}C\\sqsubseteq D\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\llbracket C\\rrbracket_{\\mathcal I}^{\\mathsf{EL}}\\subseteq\n\\llbracket D\\rrbracket_{\\mathcal I}^{\\mathsf{EL}}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal K\\Vdash_{\\mathsf{EL}}I\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\mathcal K=(\\mathcal T,\\varnothing,\\varnothing)\\land I\\in\\mathsf{Inc}_{\\mathsf{EL}}\\land\n\\forall\\mathcal I\\in\\mathsf{Str}_{\\mathsf{EL}}\n((\\forall J\\in\\mathcal T\\ \\mathcal I\\models_{\\mathsf{EL}}J)\\Rightarrow\n\\mathcal I\\models_{\\mathsf{EL}}I).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal K\\Vdash_{\\mathsf{EL}}I\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\mathcal K=(\\mathcal T,\\varnothing,\\varnothing)\\land I\\in\\mathsf{Inc}_{\\mathsf{EL}}\\land\n\\forall\\mathcal I\\in\\mathsf{Str}_{\\mathsf{EL}}\n((\\forall J\\in\\mathcal T\\ \\mathcal I\\models_{\\mathsf{EL}}J)\\Rightarrow\n\\mathcal I\\models_{\\mathsf{EL}}I).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"11.-特征差异\">11. 特征差异</h1>\n<p>定义仅用于说明语言边界的构造子标签集合</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Excluded}_{\\mathsf{EL}}\n=\n\\{\\operatorname{bottom},\\operatorname{neg},\\operatorname{or},\n\\operatorname{forall},\\operatorname{atLeast},\\operatorname{atMost}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Excluded}_{\\mathsf{EL}}\n=\n\\{\\operatorname{bottom},\\operatorname{neg},\\operatorname{or},\n\\operatorname{forall},\\operatorname{atLeast},\\operatorname{atMost}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>这些标签不属于第 1 节的 EL 原始构造子集合，因而不生成 EL 概念。</p>\n<p>EL 的目标差异对象：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Delta}_{\\mathsf{EL}}\n=\n\\bigl(\n\\{\\operatorname{top},\\operatorname{conj},\\operatorname{exists}\\},\n\\mathsf{Excluded}_{\\mathsf{EL}}\n\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Delta}_{\\mathsf{EL}}\n=\n\\bigl(\n\\{\\operatorname{top},\\operatorname{conj},\\operatorname{exists}\\},\n\\mathsf{Excluded}_{\\mathsf{EL}}\n\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>第一分量只含正概念构造；第二分量明确排除否定、析取、全称限制、底概念和数目限制。</p>\n<h1 id=\"12.-整个形式系统\">12. 整个形式系统</h1>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal S_{\\mathsf{EL}}=(N_C,N_R,\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{EL}},\n\\mathsf{Inc}_{\\mathsf{EL}},\\mathsf{Jdg}_{\\mathsf{EL}},\\mathsf{KB}_{\\mathsf{EL}},\n\\operatorname{FN},\\operatorname{BN},\\operatorname{fresh}_{\\mathsf{EL}},\n\\operatorname{Sub}_{\\theta_C,\\theta_R},\\equiv_\\alpha^{\\mathsf{EL}},\n\\mathsf{Excluded}_{\\mathsf{EL}},\\mathsf{Delta}_{\\mathsf{EL}},\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{EL}},\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{EL}},\n\\operatorname{Proof}_{\\mathsf{EL}},\\vdash_{\\mathsf{EL}},\n\\mathsf{Str}_{\\mathsf{EL}},\\llbracket-\\rrbracket^{\\mathsf{EL}},\n\\models_{\\mathsf{EL}},\\Vdash_{\\mathsf{EL}}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal S_{\\mathsf{EL}}=(N_C,N_R,\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{EL}},\n\\mathsf{Inc}_{\\mathsf{EL}},\\mathsf{Jdg}_{\\mathsf{EL}},\\mathsf{KB}_{\\mathsf{EL}},\n\\operatorname{FN},\\operatorname{BN},\\operatorname{fresh}_{\\mathsf{EL}},\n\\operatorname{Sub}_{\\theta_C,\\theta_R},\\equiv_\\alpha^{\\mathsf{EL}},\n\\mathsf{Excluded}_{\\mathsf{EL}},\\mathsf{Delta}_{\\mathsf{EL}},\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{EL}},\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{EL}},\n\\operatorname{Proof}_{\\mathsf{EL}},\\vdash_{\\mathsf{EL}},\n\\mathsf{Str}_{\\mathsf{EL}},\\llbracket-\\rrbracket^{\\mathsf{EL}},\n\\models_{\\mathsf{EL}},\\Vdash_{\\mathsf{EL}}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>该系统只含 EL 句法包含演算和本地语义；不含复杂度结论或外部模型类名称。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"733-EL","text":"733 EL","level":1},{"id":"1.-原始符号","text":"1. 原始符号","level":1},{"id":"2.-概念表达式","text":"2. 概念表达式","level":1},{"id":"3.-包含式与-TBox","text":"3. 包含式与 TBox","level":1},{"id":"4.-自由名字、替换与等价","text":"4. 自由名字、替换与等价","level":1},{"id":"5.-公理集合","text":"5. 公理集合","level":1},{"id":"6.-推理规则","text":"6. 推理规则","level":1},{"id":"7.-证明对象","text":"7. 证明对象","level":1},{"id":"8.-可导出关系","text":"8. 可导出关系","level":1},{"id":"9.-语义结构与解释","text":"9. 语义结构与解释","level":1},{"id":"10.-满足关系与语义后承","text":"10. 满足关系与语义后承","level":1},{"id":"11.-特征差异","text":"11. 特征差异","level":1},{"id":"12.-